## Summary
Udemy Business subscribers receive an update on building measurable talent pipelines using the Google Certificates Collection. This initiative addresses the skills visibility gap for organizations investing in AI and digital transformation, targeting L&D leaders, CHROs, and CIOs.

## Key Points
- Organizations are heavily investing in AI and digital transformation.
- Leaders often lack visibility into whether employees have the necessary skills for business impact.
- The Google Certificates Collection offers a solution for creating measurable talent pipelines.
- Workforce development is critical for L&D leaders, CHROs, and CIOs.
- The focus is on quantifiable outcomes in talent development to drive business results.


